==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|confident|lang=fr}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈkɑn.fɪ.dɑnt/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a person in whom one can [[confide]] or share one's secrets: a friend
#: ''You love me for no other end / Than to become my '''confidant''' and friend; / As such I keep no secret from your sight.'' &mdash; Dryden.

